*   **infotainment_ux_rating:** Simple and easy to use, but basic functionality. Smartphone integration via an app (Maps + More / Volkswagen Connect). Score: 0.00.
*   **smartphone_connect_rating:** Bluetooth, USB connection. Smartphone integration via app. No CarPlay/Android Auto mentioned for this era/trim. Score: 0.00.
